				<description>&lt;p&gt;This is the first collection of characters illustrations of the &lt;em&gt;Aetherway&lt;/em&gt; project. You can find more about these characters &lt;a href=&#34;http://localhost:1313/aetherway/epic/characters/&#34;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt; .&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;I’d love to create more, but commissions keep me busy. So please consider &lt;a href=&#34;https://ko-fi.com/corbari_j&#34;&gt;supporting my work by buying me a coffee&lt;/a&gt; or by &lt;a href=&#34;naked-person/&#34;&gt;getting these designs on a T-shirt!&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;h2 id=&#34;lady-zero&#34;&gt;Lady Zero&lt;/h2&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=&#34;http://localhost:1313/aetherway/images/set-1/zero.webp&#34; alt=&#34;Lady Zero&#34;&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;h2 id=&#34;lady-spiral&#34;&gt;Lady Spiral&lt;/h2&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=&#34;http://localhost:1313/aetherway/images/set-1/spiral.webp&#34; alt=&#34;Lady Spiral&#34;&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;h2 id=&#34;lady-thread&#34;&gt;Lady Thread&lt;/h2&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=&#34;http://localhost:1313/aetherway/images/set-1/thread.webp&#34; alt=&#34;Lady Thread&#34;&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;h2 id=&#34;lady-entanglement&#34;&gt;Lady Entanglement&lt;/h2&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=&#34;http://localhost:1313/aetherway/images/set-1/entanglement.webp&#34; alt=&#34;Lady Entanglement&#34;&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;h2 id=&#34;lady-herself&#34;&gt;Lady Herself&lt;/h2&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=&#34;http://localhost:1313/aetherway/images/set-1/herself.webp&#34; alt=&#34;Lady Herself&#34;&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;h2 id=&#34;millennium-whoop&#34;&gt;Millennium Whoop&lt;/h2&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=&#34;http://localhost:1313/aetherway/images/set-1/mill-whoop.webp&#34; alt=&#34;Millennium Whoop&#34;&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description>
